---
import CliPrefix from "./CliPrefix.astro";
import SocialLinks from "./SocialLinks.astro";
import Contact from "./Contact.astro";
---

<main id="container">
    <CliPrefix useCaret={true}>
        <p>me --help</p>
    </CliPrefix>

    <div class="fade-in">
        <div class="shade"></div>
        <SocialLinks />
        <p>
            I'm a software developer from Brazil with over five years of
            experience building things for the web. React and JavaScript are
            where I've spent most of my time, but I'm also comfortable working
            across the stack with Node.js and Ruby on Rails.
        </p>

        <p>
            Most of what I enjoy about software development comes down to
            solving problems. Sometimes that's building something new, sometimes
            it's improving an existing feature, tracking down a weird production
            issue, or jumping into another part of the stack to understand
            what's actually going on.
        </p>

        <p>
            Today, I work on an international SaaS product for qualitative and
            quantitative research. Along the way, I've worked with both
            consulting and product teams, collaborated with people from
            different areas, and learned that good software is about much more
            than just writing code. I care about building things that are
            reliable, maintainable, and useful to the people who actually use
            them.
        </p>
        <CliPrefix>
            <p>contact</p>
        </CliPrefix>
        <Contact />
    </div>
</main>

<style>
    #container {
        max-width: 80ch;
        height: 100%;
        padding: 24px;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .shade {
        position: absolute;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        background-color: #211925;
        animation: fallDown 1.8s 1.5s forwards;
    }

    p {
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #e9e9f4;
    }

    .fade-in {
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        opacity: 0;
        height: 100%;
        animation: fadeIn 1.8s 1.5s forwards;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
        to {
            opacity: 1;
        }
    }

    @keyframes fallDown {
        to {
            transform: translateY(100%);
        }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        .fade-in {
            opacity: 1;
        }
    }
</style>
